@node Installation
@chapter Getting Started: Installation and First Speech

This is the canonical first-use procedure for a source-checkout installation.
It starts before Emacsvox is available, establishes an audible acceptance
checkpoint, and delays personal configuration until an isolated session has
spoken successfully.  The same chapter is published for pre-installation web
access at
@url{https://bartbunting.github.io/emacsvox/Installation.html}.

@menu
* Obtaining Emacsvox::         Obtaining Emacsvox.
* Quick Installation::         Reach an isolated first spoken session.
* Confirming First Speech::    Verify the live adapter and basic feedback.
